semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 组合 emphasizes assembling diverse, distinct parts into a harmonious functional set or team.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 组合 vs. 配合 | pèihé | 配合 focuses on cooperative coordination between teammates in dynamic action (配合默契), while 组合 denotes structural grouping.
    2 | 组合 vs. 集合 | jíhé | 集合 means rallying individuals to gather at a physical location (操场集合), whereas 组合 is configuring elements into an organized whole.
    3 | 组合 vs. 合并 | hébìng | 合并 involves merging two separate entities into one single legal or physical body, eliminating their distinct identities.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 现代企业在组建跨学科攻关团队时，非常注重不同专业背景人才的科学组合。将具有前瞻视野的战略规划师与脚踏实地的软件工程师有机组合在一起，能够碰撞出思维的灵感火花，催生出颠覆性的前沿科技成果。 | Xiàndài qǐyè zài zǔjiàn kuà-xuékē gōngguān tuánduì shí, fēicháng zhùzhòng bùtóng zhuānyè bèijǐng réncái de kēxué zǔhé. Jiāng jùyǒu qiánzhān shìyě de zhànlüè guīhuàshī yǔ jiǎotà-shídì de ruǎnjiàn gōngchéngshī yǒujī zǔhé zài yìqǐ, nénggòu pèngzhuàng chū sīwéi de línggǎn huǒhuā, cuīshēng chū diānfùxìng de qiányán kējì chéngguǒ. | Modern enterprises building interdisciplinary teams focus on blending diverse talents. Pairing visionary strategists with pragmatic software engineers sparks creative inspiration, yielding disruptive innovations. | Las empresas que crean equipos interdisciplinares buscan combinar talentos diversos. Reunir a estrategas visionarios con ingenieros prácticos detona chispas creativas, alumbrando hallazgos revolucionarios.
  #2 | 四合院正是华北民居中一种精巧绝伦的组合建筑形式。正房、东西厢房以及倒座房等单体建筑并列排布，通过回廊有机组合在一起。大户人家的四合院更是由多座院落纵横并列组合而成，展现了中国传统建筑聚散有度的非凡智慧。 | Sìhéyuàn zhèng shì Huáběi mínjū zhōng yì zhǒng jīngqiǎo-juélún de zǔhé jiànzhù xíngshì. Zhèngfáng, dōngxī xiāngfáng yǐjí dàozuòfáng děng dāntǐ jiànzhù bìngliè páibù, tōngguò huíláng yǒujī zǔhé zài yìqǐ. Dàhù rénjiā de sìhéyuàn gèng shì yóu duō zuò yuànluò zònghéng bìngliè zǔhé ér chéng, zhǎnxiàn le Zhōngguó chuántǒng jiànzhù jùsàn-yǒudù de fēifán zhìhuì. | The siheyuan is an exquisite composite architectural form. Master rooms, side wings, and southern halls align, linked by verandas. In wealthy homes, multiple courtyards combine in series, displaying classic architectural mastery. | El siheyuan es una ingeniosa estructura habitacional combinada. La sala principal, las alas laterales y estancias frontales se integran mediante galerías. En casas nobles, varios patios se yuxtaponen con sublime destreza.
